                <pb facs="0778" n="464" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg464"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/1172</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Norway</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Schmedeman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Christiania</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-04T17:00:00+01:00">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">November 4, 1914, 5 p.m.</hi>
                    </date>
                    <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received November 5, 8 a.m.</hi>] </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>The Minister for Foreign Affairs informed me he has received a note from the
                    British Government saying that British Admiralty <pb facs="0779" n="465"
                        xml:id="pg465"/> has issued statement that after November 5 the North Sea
                    must be considered military area. Vessels sailing for and from the United States
                    must change their route and pass through English Channel. Norwegian American
                    Line have informed the Minister for Foreign Affairs they can not run their large
                    steamships on this route owing to low water. This would seriously affect
                    American exports. Norwegian Government has requested British Government to
                    change route. If this is not granted Norway, Sweden, and Denmark will probably
                    protest.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Schmedeman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
